{
  "sequence_id": "seq_d749b853cf795b6a",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "You're very smart, ash. Far too smart to never be more than boss to a pack of punks."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I do wish you'd put that right hand of yours to work for me."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Is that a joke, or have you ACTUALLY gone sense sense sense sense sense sense sense sense smile?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "YOU'VE  CERTAINLY GOT TOO SMART A MOUTH, HAVEN'T YOU, ASH?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Hm?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "You used to cry over every assignment I gave you."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "HAVE YOU FOR- GOTTEN?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "unfortun- lately, I've got a bad memory."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "ISAT TO?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "But there's something you must never forget."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Ash."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "It was 1 who took you in."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "You know, Ash..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "...I HEAR YOU'VE BEEN SPENDING A LOT LATELY."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "fich"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Did you finally find a girl- friend?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T10",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "None of your business!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T11",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Don't forget me, Ash."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T12",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "You know I love you, sweet- heart."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Bay"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Thank you for your concern."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "HEY, MAN."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I HEARD YOU WERE WRESTLING WITH FORKCHOP MARVIN AGAIN."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Food"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Nah. That wasn't wrestling."
    }
  ],
